WEBVTT

00:03:30.164 --> 00:03:34.085
The great infrastructures
that we have built

00:03:34.085 --> 00:03:36.295
with ingenuity and effort

00:03:36.337 --> 00:03:38.881
during the last two centuries,

00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:43.469
the dams, the waterways,
the highways, the railways,

00:03:43.469 --> 00:03:49.100
they have been carefully engineered
for a climate that no longer exists.

00:03:50.351 --> 00:03:51.936
What can we do?

00:03:53.354 --> 00:03:55.982
I will talk about cities
because that's my territory.

00:03:56.023 --> 00:03:58.526
As chief heat officer of Athens,

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:02.989
I think of all possible efforts
in three general categories.